  "job_B9.6.6_20251003_115103": {
    "chunk_text": "Cu\u00f0berhtes lifes; ac in \u00f0issum ussum st\u00e6re W\u00e6s in \u00f0\u00e6m ilcan mynstre sum bro\u00f0or, \u00f0\u00e6s noma w\u00e6s Beado\u00feegn, se w\u00e6s lange tid cumena & cw\u00e6\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00f0a gena lifgende w\u00e6re, \u00fea he \u00feis gewrit sette. H\u00e6fde he gewitnesse & cy\u00f0nesse from eallum \u00f0\u00e6m bro\u00f0rum & from eallum \u00feam cumendum, \u00d0a eode \u00fees bro\u00f0or sume d\u00e6ge, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde his reon & his hwitlas, \u00f0am \u00f0e he in cumena bure \u00d0a he \u00f0a eft ham hwearf, \u00fea wear\u00f0 he semninga on middum \u00fe\u00e6m si\u00f0f\u00e6te mid hefigre a\u00f0le \u00dea he arisende w\u00e6s, \u00fea gefelde he his lichoman healfne d\u00e6l from \u00fe\u00e6m heafde o\u00f0 \u00fea fet mid \u00fea Weox seo adl sticcem\u00e6lum, & sona on \u00f0\u00e6re ilcan niht hefigre gefremed w\u00e6s, swa \u00f0\u00e6t, \u00f0a d\u00e6g \u00d0a w\u00e6s he mid \u00fe\u00e6re adle gew\u00e6ced & geswenced, \u00fea ge\u00feohte he on his mode nytte ge\u00feeahte, \u00dea dyde he, swa he on his mode gehogde, & his \u00f0a untruman leomo mid his crycce wre\u00f0gende Ond \u00fea betwih his gebede & bene \u00f0\u00e6t he hwon onslep. \u00d0a gefelde he, swa swa he seolfa \u00e6fter s\u00e6gde, swa swa mycel hond & brad his heafod gehrine \u00d0a \u00f0is \u00f0us geworden w\u00e6s, sona \u00f0\u00e6s \u00f0e he onwoc, \u00f0a aras he hal & gesund. Ond he for his h\u00e6lo eft Dryhtne \u00feonc sec",
